            <ArticleTitle>Emboli protection devices.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>45S-49S</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prevention of embolization and microvascular obstruction is vital to the management of acute atherosclerotic vascular disease. Emboli protection devices are needed that will provide optimal procedural efficacy and cause minimal or no provocation ofembolization during use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
